e (EBS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#remote-work-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Remote Work \u0026 Learning","description":"Remote Work \u0026 Learning","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:26:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:55+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#vietnam-national-university-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"vietnam-national-university-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-03-24T02:42:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:46:40+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"The Faculty of English (FOE) at the University of Languages and International Studies (ULIS) conducts English language classes for up to 15,000 undergraduate and graduate students per year. With the Online Management Training Company (OMT), a Vietnamese educational technology provider, the FOE migrated its LMS workloads to the AWS cloud. The FOE achieved 99.9 percent LMS platform uptime even during peak traffic periods, improving student satisfaction with 94 percent positive student ratings compared to 70 percent before migration.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/vietnam-national-university-logo%401x.c87be30c3226c9750fef3ac1a27e934d6b256c7b.png","displayLocation":"Vietnam","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2022-03-23","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/vietnam-national-university-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Vietnam National University Delivers Engaging and Seamless Language Learning on AWS Cloud","customer-name":"University of Languages and International Studies of Vietnam National University"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","descr