 well known for its early adoption of new technologies to help it transform the banking customer experience. Less obvious, but no less crucial, are the practices and mindsets that position the company to make such effective use of those new technologies—practices and mindsets that are the result of the company\u0027s conscious self-transformation into a digital technology company. The company’s recent embrace of DevOps is just the latest step.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/capital-one-logo-1x.0e2c860505af688847cd525098b3510e556ab395.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/capital-one-devops/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Capital One","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"On-Demand Infrastructure on AWS Helps Capital One DevOps Teams Move Faster Than Ever"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#global","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Global","description":"Global","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"United States","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#methodology#devops","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#methodology","name":"DevOps","description":"DevOps","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:10+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#infrastructure","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Infrastructure","description":"Infrastructure","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T04:21:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#devops","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"DevOps","description":"DevOps","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#capital-one","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Capital One","description":"Capital One","dateCreated":"2022-04-25T19:05:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-07-16T00:04:47+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#zs-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"zs-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-08-24T06:46:54+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-09-07T23:50:14+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"ZS is a management consulting and technology firm focused on transforming global healthcare and beyond. They leverage leading-edge analytics, plus the power of data, science, and products, to help clients make more intelligent decisions, deliver innovative solutions, and improve outcomes for all. Founded in 1983, ZS has more than 12,000 employees in 35 offices worldwide. More than 130 companies have already used ZS’s products to drive business decisions, and over 100,000 pharmaceutical field reps worldwide have used ZS’s insights to engage their customers. To further enhance their capabilities in the healthcare industry, ZS is continuing to enhance its portfolio of products. In 2021, ZS launched ZAIDYNTM, an intelligent, cloud-native platform that helps life sciences organizations shape the future. Its analytics, algorithms and workflows empower people, transform processes, and unlock real value. Designed to learn and grow with our clients, the platform is modular, future-ready and fueled by global connectivity. And as more people engage, share and build, our platform gets smarter—helping organizations fuel discovery, connect with customers, deliver treatments, and improve lives. Today, ZAIDYN, built on Amazon Web Services, has been launched and operated in the Chinese market.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies-cards-imgs/ZS%20logox70.83fe9de5bb0416b0e9d1345d07e48d6c55f7398d.png","displayLocation":"China","customerNameLower":"zs case study","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/zs-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"ZS Case Study","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Shaping the Future of Life Sciences with ZS China ’s ZAIDYN Platform powered By AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#china","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"China","description":"China","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:17+0000","dateU