ce and skills to migrate its learning management system to AWS through support from AWS Training and Certification. BPPTIK Kominfo delivers in-person and virtual courses to civil servants and members of the public as part of the country’s drive to increase digital skills. BPPTIK’s IT team has taken part in AWS Cloud Practitioner Essentials, AWS Technical Essentials, and Architecting on AWS courses to build cloud skills.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/BPPTIK_Kominfo_logo%401x.1dbdb02f8a7e2cc3c33e8e5a1ab5be29abf7a0c5.png","displayLocation":"Indonesia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"General Public Services","sortDate":"2021-01-12","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/bpptik-kominfo-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"BPPTIK Kominfo","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"BPPTIK Kominfo Bridges the Digital Skills Gap with LMS on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-enablement#training-cert","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-enablement","name":"Training \u0026 Certification","description":"Training \u0026 Certification","dateCreated":"2020-09-04T04:06:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:13+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:2