, and continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD) services for DevOps software development. Use machine learning (ML) -guided best practices and abstractions to improve agility, security, velocity, and code quality.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#zoop","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"zoop","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:06:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:45+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Fundada em 2013, a Zoop desenvolveu uma plataforma tecnológica whitelabel na nuvem para meios de pagamento e serviços financeiros que possibilita negócios B2B a se tornarem fintechs. A companhia já nasceu praticamente na nuvem AWS.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/Latam%20Cases%20Assets/Logo%20Zoop_v1.92a0cbb642d8323ba9f093769c53ab45aab9c5ad.jpg","displayLocation":"Brasil","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Serviços financeiros","sortDate":"2019-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/zoop/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"História do cliente","customer-name":"Zoop","headline":"Estudo de caso AWS: Zoop"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#api-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon API Gateway","description":"Amazon API Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#c