rgets are met. The fintech uses Amazon Virtual Private Cloud to segregate client networks, Amazon Elastic Container Service to run serverless computing, and AWS Identity and Access Management for account authentication.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/customers/FinFabrik_Logo.f2e380005f93255e90383baf1db73b196ef39fff.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the FinFabrik customer case study. FinFabrik is a Hong Kong\u0013based fintech company that creates software-as-a-service applications to facilitate trading multiple assets such as equities and cryptoassets. Its mission is to empower capital markets businesses and individuals to access more investment opportunity.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/finfabrik/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"FinFabrik","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study - FinFabrik"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Startup","description":"Startup","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-