zon WorkSpaces","description":"Amazon WorkSpaces","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2022-01-10T20:16:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-mcdonalds-home-delivery","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-mcdonalds-home-delivery","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:58:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:40:50+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Using AWS, McDonald\u0027s Corporation transformed into a digital technology company, beat performance targets by up to 66 percent, and completes 8,600 transactions per second via its point-of-sale (POS) system. McDonald\u0027s Corporation is an American hamburger and fast food restaurant chain that serves 69 million customers each day. McDonald\u0027s uses a number of AWS services including Amazon EC2, Elastic Load Balancing, Amazon EBS, and Amazon ElastiCache to support its global POS system, including 200,000 registers and 300,000 POS devices.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/McDonalds_Customer-Reference_Logo.8197f6c1344756e2051566dbaa8a463bbc552030.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the McDonalds customer case study, powered by the AWS cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2016-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mcdonalds/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"McDonalds","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2016","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"McDonalds Case Study"}},"tags":[{"