d to lower costs and improve its infrastructure. Moving to AWS allows Kempinski to focus on improving core processes instead of IT while saving an estimated 40 percent in IT costs over a five-year period.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Kempinski_Customer-Reference_Logo.21804d2a0db58d3c6dbd2310b735f21e15f6c58d.png","displayLocation":"Switzerland","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eKempinski Hotels, an international luxury hotel group based in Geneva, Switzerland, wanted to lower costs and improve its infrastructure. Moving to AWS allows Kempinski to focus on improving core processes instead of IT while saving an estimated 40% in IT costs over a five-year period.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/kempinski-hotels/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Kempinski Hotels","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: Kempinski Hotels"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#business-applications","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Cost Management","description":"Cost Management","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:12+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":